-- Mishwarak: cover 33 major Saudi cities outside Riyadh Region with synthetic demo places: 2 places per
-- subcategory around each city center (56 per city, 1,848 in all).
--
-- City centers are OpenStreetMap place nodes (SAUDI_CITIES in src/lib/catalog.ts); each place sits
-- 0.4–1.3 km from it. Every row is named "تجريبي - ..." and marked synthetic. No rating, review count,
-- price level or hours is invented: those columns are NULL.
--
-- Idempotent: safe to re-run. Rows are keyed by seed_key and inserted only when missing; existing
-- rows, plans, visits, reviews, preferences and feedback are never updated or deleted.

